{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Project A-ko: Uncivil Wars","A-ko and B-ko are bounty hunters in an untamed world. When a young heiress, C-ko, falls out of the sky and into their hair, they find themselves battling space pirates and galactic police. Turns out the high-pitched, hungry C-ko holds a secret &mdash;the spirit of an ancient evil&mdash; and is the center of a plot to destroy the universe!"],"ja":["A-Ko The VS",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1295","ids":{"shikimori":1295,"mal":1295,"anilist":1295,"kodik":"serial-25230"},"kodikIds":["serial-32336","serial-25230"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-32336":"2021-02-16T21:58:51Z","serial-25230":"2020-04-28T14:39:41Z"},"title":"Проект А-ко: Противостояние","originalTitle":"A-Ko the Versus","alt":"Project A-ko: Uncivil Wars","description":"А-ко и Б-ко - охотники за головами в диком мире. Когда молодая наследница Си-ко падает с неба им на волосы, им приходится сражаться с космическими пиратами и галактической полицией. Оказывается, пронзительный, голодный Си-ко владеет тайной - духом древнего зла — и является центром заговора, направленного на уничтожение вселенной!","year":1990,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Романтика","Фантастика","супер сила"],"rating":6.29,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1295/d2896a8b4ae5c21fe877d2a95f4c2544.jpeg","width":995,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/8ee4873a3893c2e1792ade2b960386961377185c.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[2],"episodes":[{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-32336","translationId":"674","url":"https://kodikplayer.co